  "phaseRules": [
    "ExternalSecret drain waits without a journal while exact deleting objects remain; CreateOrMerge/Retain is accepted, unknown policy/finalizer or insufficient ESO/RBAC stops.",
    "Business Namespace and NodePool/EC2NodeClass deletes require exact UID/resourceVersion and known native finalizers; no finalizer edit is implemented.",
    "Runtime drain records completion only after all reviewed aggregate counts are zero and state is unchanged.",
    "Captured ENI is decided and post-confirmed absent before the SG decision; exact owner/network, unattached/unassociated status and no other SG reference are mandatory.",
    "Each simulated mutation has a durable intent, fresh recheck, one fixed fake call, independent postcondition and terminal or pending evidence semantics."
  ],
  "limitations": [
    "All identities, observations, clocks, prices and mutation acknowledgements are scripted fixture bytes, not live cloud or Kubernetes evidence.",
    "The adapter performs no SDK, CLI, subprocess, environment, endpoint, Terraform or system-clock access.",
    "The fixed fake class guards accidental backend mixups; it is not a hostile-code sandbox.",
    "The journal gives at-most-once semantics only for the approved directory and operation tag; it is not authorization.",
    "No ExternalSecret finalizer removal, forced Namespace/PV cleanup, backup/container deletion or live adapter migration is implemented.",
    "Historical aws-test teardown and scoped audit remain closed; prior approvals, windows and markers are not reusable."
